61
00:03:17,270 --> 00:03:20,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eu finalmente descobri a fraqueza daquele pivete!</font>

62
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:24,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A cauda é o ponto fraco!</font>

63
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:26,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Que notícia maravilhosa, Imperador Pilaf.</font>

64
00:03:26,650 --> 00:03:28,610
