<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sim!</font>

176
00:11:56,870 --> 00:12:00,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">É um prazer te ver novamente, Mestre Roshi.</font>

177
00:12:00,770 --> 00:12:04,510
